## FilterExec on an equality
  allowed emission_type_holds: the filter keeps one row in 16 and emits batches of 8192 rows (filter.rs:81), so it needs about 131072 rows per input partition before it emits, more than the unbounded input delivers (65536)
  case seed 1: no violations
  case seed 2: no violations
  case 2 partitions: no violations
  case 5 partitions: no violations
  case large input: no violations

